<title>CANADA: Air Canada Cargo adds internet tracking.</title>
<headline>Air Canada Cargo adds internet tracking.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air Canada Cargo said its customers now can track and trace cargo shipments in progress through a new search driver at the airline's home page on the world wide web.</p>
<p>The cargo enhancements also include up-to-the-minute flight information and the airline's full cargo service guide. -- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
